sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Hosted HTML or browser agent
    participant Runtime as runtime.js
    participant Hosted as Instance RPC handler
    participant Catalog as Catalog read service
    participant DB as Existing PostgreSQL and blobs
    App->>Runtime: slop_boutique.list({kind: artifact})
    Runtime->>Hosted: POST view RPC with instance grant
    Hosted->>Hosted: Authenticate current user and membership
    Hosted->>Catalog: List(ctx, verified user, query)
    Catalog->>DB: Select listed artifacts with published releases
    DB-->>Catalog: Bounded rows
    Catalog-->>App: Public summaries and next cursor
